ing is generated at runtime. See which parts of QuestAway use AI."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5195600/3bbe13e170d8549132e3079ff22a992104987180/capsule_616x353.jpg?t=1792803036"/><link rel="modulepreload" href="/assets/index-9dDQvLNP.js"/><link rel="modulepreload" href="/assets/layers-3cLAEgxw.js"/><link rel="modulepreload" href="/assets/_slug-Dda2UhF1.js"/><link rel="modulepreload" href="/assets/LayerStrip-AdBcUwO6.js"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin="anonymous"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://howmuchai.games/game/questaway"/></head><body><header class="site-header pad"><div class="wrap nav"><a class="logo" href="/"><span class="logo-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>HowMuchAI</a><nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Main"><a href="/ai">Browse</a><a href="/developers">Developers</a></nav><form role="search" class="search " action="/search" method="get"><label class="sr-only" for="q-sm">Search Steam games</label><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"></path></svg><input id="q-sm" type="search" placeholder="Search games" autoComplete="off" enterKeyHint="search" name="q"/></form></div></header><main class="pad"><div class="wrap"><!--$--><article class="game"><p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/ai">Browse</a> / <!-- -->QuestAway</p><header class="game-head"><div><h1>Is <!-- -->QuestAway<!-- --> AI generated?</h1><p class="meta"><a href="/developer/art-x-games">ART X GAMES</a><span>Oct 23, 2026</span><a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5195600/" rel="nofollow noopener">Steam page ↗</a></p><p class="verdict">Some art (character and enemy models, portraits, icons), trailer music, some sound effects and voices were AI-generated and team-edited; nothing is generated at runtime.</p><p class="flag">The disclosure hedges how much was made with AI (&quot;some&quot;, &quot;certain assets&quot;).</p></div><img src="https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5195600/3bbe13e170d8549132e3079ff22a992104987180/capsule_616x353.jpg?t=1792803036" alt="QuestAway header image" width="460" height="215"/></header><section class="label" aria-labelledby="label"><div class="label-head"><h2 id="label">AI by part, from the developer&#x27;s disclosure</h2><span class="mono mute">5 of 9 parts mention AI</span></div><ul class="label-cells"><li><a href="/ai/art"><span class="cell generated " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lname">Art</span><span class="lstatus">AI-generated</span></a></li><li><a href="/ai/store-page"><span class="cell generated " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lname">Store page</span><span class="lstatus">AI-generated</span></a></li><li><a href="/ai/voice"><span class="cell generated " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lname">Voice</span><span class="lstatus">AI-generated</span></a></li><li><a href="/ai/music"><span class="cell generated " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lname">Music</span><span class="lstatus">AI-generated</span></a></li><li><a href="/ai/sound-effects"><span class="cell generated " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lname">Sound effects</span><span class="lstatus">AI-generated</span></a></li><li><a href="/ai/writing"><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lname">Writing</span><span class="lstatus">Not mentioned</span></a></li><li><a href="/ai/translation"><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lname">Translation</span><span class="lstatus">Not mentioned</span></a></li><li><a href="/ai/code"><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lname">Code</span><span class="lstatus">Not mentioned</span></a></li><li><a href="/ai/live-generation"><span class="cell none " aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="lname">Live generation</span><span class="lstatus">Says no AI</span></a></li></ul></section><div class="cols"><section aria-labelledby="disclosure"><h2 id="disclosure">What the developer wrote</h2><blockquote>Some of the game&#x27;s art assets, such as character and enemy models, portraits and icons, were created during development with the assistance of generative AI tools, and were then reviewed, curated and edited by the team. The music in our trailer and some of the game&#x27;s sound effects and voices were also generated with AI tools, then edited and mixed by the team. All AI-assisted content is pre-rendered: nothing is generated while the game is running.</blockquote><p class="source">Steam &quot;AI Generated Content Disclosure&quot; · first seen <!-- -->Oct 26, 2026<!-- --> · last checked<!-- --> <!-- -->Nov 1, 2026</p></section><section aria-labelledby="parts"><h2 id="parts">Part by part</h2><table class="layers"><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/ai/art">Art</a><span>In-game art, sprites, textures, 3D models</span></th><td><span class="chip generated"><span class="cell generated " aria-hidden="true"></span>AI-generated</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/ai/store-page">Store page</a><span>Capsules, screenshots, trailers, store text</span></th><td><span class="chip generated"><span class="cell generated " aria-hidden="true"></span>AI-generated</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/ai/voice">Voice</a><span>Voice acting and narration</span></th><td><span class="chip generated"><span class="cell generated " aria-hidden="true"></span>AI-generated</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/ai/music">Music</a><span>Soundtrack</span></th><td><span class="chip generated"><span class="cell generated " aria-hidden="true"></span>AI-generated</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/ai/sound-effects">Sound effects</a><span>Sound effects and ambience</span></th><td><span class="chip generated"><span class="cell generated " aria-hidden="true"></span>AI-generated</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/ai/writing">Writing</a><span>Story, dialogue, item and quest text</span></th><td><span class="chip not_mentioned"><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span>Not mentioned</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/ai/translation">Translation</a><span>Localized versions</span></th><td><span class="chip not_mentioned"><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span>Not mentioned</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/ai/code">Code</a><span>Programming and tooling</span></th><td><span class="chip not_mentioned"><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span>Not mentioned</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/ai/live-generation">Live generation</a><span>Content generated while you play</span></th><td><span class="chip none"><span class="cell none " aria-hidden="true"></span>Says no AI</span></td></tr></tbody></table><div style="margin-top:16px"><ul class="legend"><li><span class="cell generated " aria-hidden="true"></span><span>AI-generated</span></li><li><span class="cell assisted " aria-hidden="true"></span><span>AI-assisted</span></li><li><span class="cell unclear " aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Mentioned, unclear</span></li><li><span class="cell none " aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Says no AI</span></li><li><span class="cell not_mentioned " aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Not mentioned</span></li></ul></div></section></div><section aria-labelledby="reports"><h2 id="reports">Player reports</h2><div class="soon"><p>Played <!-- -->QuestAway<!-- -->? Soon you&#x27;ll be able to sign in with Steam and report what you saw in each part.</p><p>Reports from players with the game in their library will sit next to the developer&#x27;s disclosure, never replace it.</p></div></section></article><!--/$--></div></main><footer class="site-footer pad"><div cl